---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
历史上的今天 for the resource hub (assets/js/feed.js): every entry of the library
by the month and day it was published, {"MMDD": [{t title, u url, y year, k kind,
c cover}, ...]}. The kind follows entry-card.html's rule; the cover is the card's
(cover-fallback.html). About 100 KB for a thousand entries.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fd_posts = site.posts | where_exp: "post", "post.search != false" -%}
{%- assign fd_groups = fd_posts | group_by_exp: "p", "p.date | date: '%m%d'" | sort: "name" -%}
{
{%- for g in fd_groups -%}
{{ g.name | jsonify }}:[
{%- for p in g.items -%}
{%- assign fd_archive = p.archive_type | default: p.resource_type -%}
{%- assign fd_kind = "文章" -%}
{%- if fd_archive == "scan_translation" -%}{%- assign fd_kind = "扫描翻译" -%}
{%- elsif p.layout == "interview-editorial" or p.layout == "parallel-translation" or fd_archive == "interview_translation" or p.categories contains "访谈翻译" -%}{%- assign fd_kind = "访谈翻译" -%}
{%- elsif fd_archive == "gamefreak_director_column" or fd_archive == "gamefreak_masuda_lineblog" or fd_archive == "gamefreak_legacy_blog" -%}{%- assign fd_kind = "Game Freak 博客" -%}
{%- elsif p.categories contains "文档" -%}{%- assign fd_kind = "文档" -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign fd_cover = p.image | default: p.featured_image | default: "" -%}
{%- if fd_cover == "" -%}
  {%- assign fd_items = p.translation_segments | default: p.parallel_items -%}
  {%- if fd_items -%}
    {%- assign fd_pics = fd_items | where: "type", "image" -%}
    {%- assign fd_pic = fd_pics.first.image | default: fd_pics.first.src | default: fd_pics.first.original | default: "" -%}
    {%- if fd_pic != "" -%}{%- assign fd_cover = fd_pic -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- include cover-fallback.html post=p cover=fd_cover -%}
{"t":{{ p.display_title | default: p.title | jsonify }},"u":{{ p.url | relative_url | jsonify }},"y":{{ p.date | date: "%Y" }},"k":{{ fd_kind | jsonify }},"c":{{ cf_cover | default: "" | relative_url | jsonify }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
}
